1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,910
In my family, when the phone rings after ten, somebody

2
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:08,440
is sitting in a room with a table, two chairs, and a man

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,340
telling them this is their only chance.

4
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:14,560
I know that room. I sat in it at seventeen.

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,710
Nobody asked me what happened.

6
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:19,310
Not the police. Not the prosecutor.

7
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,320
Not even the lawyer I paid.

8
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,370
Nobody asked what happened.

9
00:00:24,362 --> 00:00:28,892
Let me tell you where we're from first.

10
00:00:29,282 --> 00:00:32,312
Because nobody in those rooms ever did.

11
00:00:33,062 --> 00:00:37,342
On our block, you learn the sound of gunshots before you

12
00:00:37,342 --> 00:00:38,812
