13
00:00:39,682 --> 00:00:41,512
Cars slow down for no reason.

14
00:00:41,722 --> 00:00:43,812
Somebody's cousin didn't make it home.

15
00:00:44,422 --> 00:00:48,252
Last summer, the police take 40 minutes, they stay calm.

16
00:00:48,702 --> 00:00:51,512
So people get protection however they can.

17
00:00:52,942 --> 00:00:55,262
Nobody's thinking about paperwork.

18
00:00:55,262 --> 00:00:59,292
They're thinking about getting home alive.

19
00:01:00,642 --> 00:01:03,582
When the danger is that close, being safe matters more

20
00:01:03,582 --> 00:01:07,942
than being legal. And a lot of people in danger aren't

21
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:10,072
even old enough to be legal yet.

22
00:01:10,562 --> 00:01:11,972
That's not an excuse.

23
00:01:12,022 --> 00:01:15,412
It's the truth. Nobody puts in the report.

24
00:01:16,342 --> 00:01:19,572
The Bible has a word for people like us, the oppressed.

25
00:01:20,602 --> 00:01:23,462
Under-protected when we call for help, over watched when

26
00:01:23,462 --> 00:01:26,612
we're just standing outside, over punished when we slip,

27
00:01:26,862 --> 00:01:30,062
and with no opportunities to get out from under any of

28
00:01:30,062 --> 00:01:33,442
it. The police don't come when we need them, but they

29
00:01:33,442 --> 00:01:37,302
come for us. It started under a picture online.

30
00:01:37,302 --> 00:01:39,912
Two girls I barely knew decided I was the problem.

31
00:01:40,182 --> 00:01:42,662
Comments turned into messages, messages turned into I

32
00:01:42,662 --> 00:01:43,852
know where you stay.

33
00:01:44,182 --> 00:01:45,422
Then came a house party.

34
00:01:45,422 --> 00:01:46,882
I didn't go looking for them.

35
00:01:46,882 --> 00:01:48,312
They came looking for me.

36
00:01:48,582 --> 00:01:49,932
Both of them were 19.

37
00:01:49,942 --> 00:01:52,292
I was 17. The first one swung.

38
00:01:52,882 --> 00:01:55,152
The bottle was already in my hand.

39
00:01:55,502 --> 00:01:58,842
When it was over, her tooth was gone, and I was the one

40
00:01:58,842 --> 00:02:02,732
the police wanted. They didn't find me on their own.

41
00:02:02,942 --> 00:02:06,592
The girls gave them my relatives' information.

42
00:02:07,582 --> 00:02:09,992
Jada. Jada went to school with them.

43
00:02:10,222 --> 00:02:13,462
Her mother got on the phone and made her give the police

44
00:02:13,462 --> 00:02:16,432
