45
00:02:17,722 --> 00:02:20,752
Jada and I haven't talked since.

46
00:02:21,702 --> 00:02:25,812
One phone call can change who your family is to you.

47
00:02:26,662 --> 00:02:28,852
The report said I hit her with a bottle.

48
00:02:28,862 --> 00:02:32,402
That was true. It didn't say she came at me first.

49
00:02:32,402 --> 00:02:34,372
It didn't say there were two of them.

50
00:02:34,662 --> 00:02:36,952
Felonious assault, one night in jail.

51
