I didn't wait for a public defender.

52
00:02:43,362 --> 00:02:45,032
I paid for a lawyer myself.

53
00:02:45,402 --> 00:02:55,222
Me, 17 years old. $1 ,600 at the front and the remainder

54
00:02:55,222 --> 00:03:00,152
of $10 ,000, every dollar I worked for it.

55
00:03:01,082 --> 00:03:07,782
I met him for maybe 10 minutes at a time, twice, always

56
00:03:07,782 --> 00:03:11,062
