58
00:03:15,182 --> 00:03:20,792
or gray paintings. And my folder was just one of them.

59
00:03:21,062 --> 00:03:23,182
He never asked me what happened once.

60
00:03:23,182 --> 00:03:27,802
He never asked about the messages or that there were two

61
00:03:27,802 --> 00:03:30,292
of them or who swung first.

62
00:03:30,542 --> 00:03:34,922
And it's quite odd because he read the reports from the

63
00:03:34,922 --> 00:03:38,212
both of them and that didn't trigger in his mind.

64
00:03:38,402 --> 00:03:42,822
I'm looking at the date of birth and the reports that

65
00:03:42,822 --> 00:03:44,412
I have been junked.

66
00:03:44,802 --> 00:03:47,192
All he said is,

67
00:03:47,202 --> 00:03:48,352
LAWYER: There's a youth program.

68
00:03:48,642 --> 00:03:51,892
LAWYER: Plead, finish your probation and it comes off your record.

69
00:03:52,222 --> 00:03:54,832
LAWYER: Fight it and you're betting your whole life on a jury.

70
00:03:55,782 --> 00:03:58,062
I paid him like a private lawyer and he treated me like

71
00:03:58,062 --> 00:04:00,932
